OL,3,GNEWSARush hour M6 closure after car and
OL,4,Alorry crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M6 in Staffordshire
OL,7,Fhas been shut during rush hour
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash involving a car and a
OL,9,Florry.
OL,11,FThe crash happened just before 08:30
OL,12,FGMT between junction 14 for Stafford
OL,13,Fand junction 15 for Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,15,FNational Highways confirmed the road
OL,16,Fhad been closed in both directions
OL,17,Fwhile police, fire crews and medics -
OL,18,Fincluding the air ambulance - attend
OL,19,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
