OL,3,GNEWSARush hour M6 closure after car and
OL,4,Alorry crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men were treated for injuries that
OL,7,Fare not believed to be serious and have
OL,8,Fbeen taken to Royal Stoke University
OL,9,FHospital by land ambulance, West
OL,10,FMidlands Ambulance service said.
